{"id":"wb-7-1889","name":"平安桥天主教堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"平安桥主教座堂","text":"圣母无染原罪主教座堂，俗称平安桥主教座堂或平安桥天主教堂，是天主教成都教区的主教座堂，位于四川省成都市青羊区西华门街（原平安桥街）25号。由大、小经堂和主教公馆等建筑组成，建筑面积8508平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%89%E6%A1%A5%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99%E5%BA%A7%E5%A0%82","revisionId":93099198,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93099198","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ca13105e32479583ad6c6095.png","title":"Cathedral_of_the_Immaculate_Conception,_Chengdu.png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cathedral_of_the_Immaculate_Conception,_Chengdu.png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/Cathedral_of_the_Immaculate_Conception%2C_Chengdu.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Jeong zeno","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Front view of Immaculate Conception Cathedral at Chengdu, Sichuan, seat of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Chengdu.","width":320,"height":207}}